    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_03",
      "hash64": "E7EEF1AC2C216F2B",
      "text": "¿Cuál es tu duda pues?[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_nelke_08",
      "hash64": "5C185D40FEE607D5",
      "text": "Me he fijado en que no tratas a vuestra jefa igual\\nque los demás Reclutas.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_nelke_09",
      "hash64": "5C185C40FEE60622",
      "text": "Quería saber por qué.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_04",
      "hash64": "E7EEF6AC2C2177AA",
      "text": "Menudo ojo tienes...[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_05",
      "hash64": "E7EEF7AC2C21795D",
      "text": "Pues veréis, al principio no tragaba a Erin.\\nMe caía fatal.[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 59,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
