    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_07",
      "hash64": "E7EEF5AC2C2175F7",
      "text": "Se hizo muy popular desde el mismo momento\\nen el que llegó a la academia.[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_08",
      "hash64": "E7EEEAAC2C216346",
      "text": "Y no me extraña... Con lo guapa que es y lo bien\\nque se le dan los deportes y los combates...[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_09",
      "hash64": "E7EEEBAC2C2164F9",
      "text": "Yo era la más popular antes de que llegase y me\\nsentí totalmente desplazada.[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_nelke_11",
      "hash64": "5C14E040FEE2FD97",
      "text": "¿Y por eso le hiciste la cruz?[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_10",
      "hash64": "E7F278AC2C248A67",
      "text": "Sí. Entre otros compañeros y yo empezamos a\\nmeternos con ella y tal...\\c\\nNos portamos como unos verdaderos imbéciles.[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
